repository-code: https://github.com/CTOUT/Symdicate
url: https://github.com/CTOUT/Symdicate
abstract: >
  A composable multi-agent framework for GitHub Copilot built around agents with
  structured cognitive identities. NeuroGraft, the meta-agent, overlays personas
  onto any Copilot agent at one of four cognitive levels without replacing its
  underlying capabilities.
keywords:
